The public-domain dedication in UNLICENSE applies only to this component's
original code, original/generated artwork, and original texture layouts. It does
not apply to the third-party netherite horse armor assets described below.

Original item artwork was developed using OpenAI ImageGen. Horseshoes and saddles
were cleaned up on a native 16x16 pixel grid; tools/build-item-textures.ps1 records
and regenerates their final pixels. The horse effigy reuses the wooden chess
knight created for this project. Prompts are recorded in art-prompts.json.
tools/build-entity-textures.ps1 regenerates the original hoof and saddle atlases.

Minecraft, NeoForge, and their models, APIs, and runtime resources remain the
property of their respective authors. The renderer references Minecraft's horse
models and GUI resources at runtime; those models are not bundled here.

